                                <button onclick="removeChatterFromGroup(1, 1789193803260, &#39;batushka&#39;)" class="hover:text-red-300">×</button>
                            </span><span class="bg-[#5D5CDE] text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-sm flex items-center gap-2">Drobeen
